{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "digi-payment-gateway-collection",
    "name": "Digi Payment Gateway",
    "description": "REST API for the Digi Payment Gateway Spring Boot service.\n\n## Authentication\n\n| Area | Header | Notes |\n|------|--------|-------|\n| Integration (`/api/v1/integration/**`) | `X-API-Key` | Merchant API key from `merchant.api_key` |\n| Portal (`/api/**` except integration & webhooks) | `Authorization: Bearer <token>` | JWT infrastructure exists; no login endpoint yet |\n| Webhooks (`/webhook/**`) | None | Public |\n| Actuator (`/actuator/**`) | Bearer JWT | No public health endpoint; API key does not apply |\n\n## Local setup\n\n1. Start PostgreSQL and run `scripts/sql/postgresql/merchant-setup.sql`\n2. Run the app with `dev` profile (default port `8080`)\n3. Import **Digi-Payment-Gateway-Local** environment and select it\n4. Variables: `baseUrl`, `apiKey`, `paymentId`, `channelKey`\n\n## Suggested local flow (TEST channel)\n\n1. **Integration → Generate checkout** (saves `paymentId`)\n2. Open `checkoutUrl` in a browser (optional — `test-checkout.html`)\n3. **Webhooks → TEST channel webhook** (ack only — processing stubbed)\n4. **Integration → Get transaction by ID**\n\n## Seed merchant (dev)\n\n- API key: `b4bdb71a-51c5-4565-985d-e0c13f72b970`\n- Payment channel: `TEST`\n\n## Webhook note\n\n`PaymentChannelWebhookController` currently returns **200 OK with an empty body**. Orchestration (`processWebhook`) is not wired yet; payloads are logged only.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "apiKey",
      "value": "b4bdb71a-51c5-4565-985d-e0c13f72b970",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "paymentId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "channelKey",
      "value": "test",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "bearerToken",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Integration (X-API-Key)",
      "description": "Merchant integration APIs. Authenticate with the `X-API-Key` header (merchant API key).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Generate checkout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "function setSharedVar(key, value) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(key, value);",
                  "    if (pm.environment.name) {",
                  "        pm.environment.set(key, value);",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (body.paymentId) {",
                  "        setSharedVar('paymentId', String(body.paymentId));",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has paymentId', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('paymentId');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('checkoutUrl');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('status');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchantReferenceId\": \"order-1001\",\n  \"amount\": 99.50,\n  \"merchantMetadataJson\": \"{\\\"table\\\":\\\"T5\\\"}\",\n  \"redirectSuccessUrl\": \"https://merchant.example/success\",\n  \"redirectFailureUrl\": \"https://merchant.example/failure\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integration/checkout/generate",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "integration",
                "checkout",
                "generate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Creates a payment record and returns a channel-specific payment link.\n\n**Request body (`CheckoutRequest`)**\n\n| Field | Type | Required |\n|-------|------|----------|\n| `merchantReferenceId` | string | yes |\n| `amount` | number (min 0.01) | yes |\n| `merchantMetadataJson` | string | no |\n| `redirectSuccessUrl` | string | no |\n| `redirectFailureUrl` | string | no |\n\n**Response (`CheckoutResponse`, 201)**\n\n| Field | Type |\n|-------|------|\n| `paymentId` | long |\n| `checkoutUrl` | string |\n| `paymentChannelTxnId` | string |\n| `status` | enum: INITIATED, CHECKOUT_GENERATED, SUCCESS, FAILED, REFUNDED, VOIDED |"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List transactions",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response is an array', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integration/transactions",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "integration",
                "transactions"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns all payments for the authenticated merchant.\n\n**Response:** array of `PaymentDetailsResponse` objects."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get transaction by ID",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response has payment id', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('id');",
                  "    pm.expect(body).to.have.property('status');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "X-API-Key",
                "value": "{{apiKey}}",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integration/transactions/{{paymentId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "integration",
                "transactions",
                "{{paymentId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns a single payment for the authenticated merchant.\n\n**Path parameter:** `id` — payment ID (use `{{paymentId}}` from Generate checkout).\n\n**404** if payment does not exist or belongs to another merchant."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhooks (public)",
      "description": "Inbound payment-channel webhooks. No authentication required.\n\n**Current behavior:** returns `200 OK` with an **empty body** (orchestration stubbed; payload logged only).\n\n`channelKey` is case-insensitive and maps to `PaymentChannelNameEnum`: stripe, razorpay, phonepe, paytm, google_pay, xplorpay, paymob, test.\n\nWhen webhook processing is enabled, TEST channel will expect `paymentStatus` + `paymentId` in the JSON body.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "TEST channel webhook (success)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200 OK', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Empty body (webhook orchestration stubbed)', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.be.empty;",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"paymentStatus\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"paymentId\": {{paymentId}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/webhook/v1/payment-channel/{{channelKey}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "webhook",
                "v1",
                "payment-channel",
                "{{channelKey}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Simulates a TEST payment channel webhook.\n\n**Current response:** `200 OK`, empty body (processing not wired).\n\n**Future TEST payload (when orchestration is enabled):**\n- `paymentStatus` — PaymentStatusEnum name (e.g. SUCCESS, FAILED)\n- `paymentId` — numeric payment ID\n\n**Future response (`WebhookStrategyResponse`):** `status`, `paymentId`, `paymentChannelTxnId`, `merchantReferenceId`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
