    {
      "name": "Actuator (dev)",
      "description": "Spring Boot Actuator. In `dev` profile all endpoints are exposed (`management.endpoints.web.exposure.include=*`). Secured by Spring Security — returns `401` without a valid Bearer JWT (`X-API-Key` does not apply outside integration routes).",
      "item": [
